{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "002ab003-8114-8d06-aa15-139d5406f2d0",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:20:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yuki Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:16:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:16:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Before we start, could I get your name again? Lorraine, and is that spelled the usual way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:16:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, L-O-R-R-A-I-N-E. Medeiros is the last name, M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. My name is Yuki Cohen. I'm a property manager, and I'm calling to report road damage. The edge of the pavement is crumbling at a curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Crumbling at the edge, at a curve. Where is this, Yuki?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:16:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right at 9 Harrison Avenue, on the Fort Adams side. The curve is just in front of the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "9 Harrison Avenue. And let me make sure I have it right, it's the edge of the road itself, not the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, the road edge. The asphalt along the shoulder is breaking off and there are loose chunks in the gutter line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:17:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Do you have a sense of how big the damaged area is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:17:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I measured it roughly this morning. It's about two feet across. I'm writing all this down, so go ahead if you need anything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across, okay, I'm putting that in. Did this just start, or has it been getting worse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was a small crack before. With the rain that came in Wednesday and wrapped up today, it clearly broke apart. I noticed it when I came in this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, water gets under the edge and it lets go. Is it out in the travel lane at all, or just along the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just along the side for now. A car going around the curve would have to be close to the edge to hit it, but they do cut it close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that it's on a curve so the crew knows to look at it. Let me read back what I have. Road edge crumbling at the curve, 9 Harrison Avenue, about two feet across, started breaking up after the rain. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:18:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Can I ask how long repairs usually take? I'd like to write down a rough timeframe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a storm like this, crews have a list of reports to get through, so it's often a matter of days to a couple of weeks. Cold weather matters too, since they sometimes put in a temporary patch first. I'd say plan on a window rather than a specific day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:18:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Days to a couple of weeks, temporary patch possible. Okay. I'll note that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back if the crew has an update? I'd need a number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's 401-555-0152."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-two. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's my cell. I'm on it now, so if it cuts out, that's the number to use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. And the best name on the request is Yuki Cohen, C-O-H-E-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Sorry, that took a bit. I'm also halfway through a long novel about a lighthouse keeper, so I'm used to going slowly and carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing wrong with that. Slow and careful gets the request right. Anything else you want to add about the curve?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's everything. Is there a reference number for the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:19:50-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll give you the request number. It's going to be on the confirmation I send out, but let me make sure it's saved first. [pause] Okay, it's in. I'll note that it's a road edge issue so it goes to the right crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have all the steps written down. I appreciate your help, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Yuki. Have a good rest of your Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T09:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
